    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "You hurl a bolt of light toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 4d6 Radiant damage, and the next attack roll made against it before the end of your next turn has Advantage.",
        "Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1."
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>You hurl a bolt of light toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 4d6 Radiant damage, and the next attack roll made against it before the end of your next turn has Advantage.</p> <p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.</p> </div>",
